<title>UK: WESTLB ADDS 500 MLN MARKS TO OCTOBER 2005 BOND. [CORRECTED 10:05 GMT]</title>
<headline>WESTLB ADDS 500 MLN MARKS TO OCTOBER 2005 BOND. [CORRECTED 10:05 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was increased to 2.0 billion marks from 1.5 billion marks, joint lead managers Westdeutsche Landesbank, Bayerische Landesbank, Bankgesellschaft Berlin, Deutsche Girozentrale-Deutsche Kommunalbank and Landesbank Rheinland-Pfalz said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    14.OCT.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.21     PAY DATE    18.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   REOFFER    97.965    LISTING     DUES</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 MGT/UND     8 BP     SELL CONC   24.5 BP</p>
<p>(Corrects split of fees from 10 bps for management and underwriting</p>
<p>and 22.5 bps for selling concession)</p>
<p> SPREAD     FLAT TO OCTOBER 2005 BUND</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBREIF 7503</p>
<p>		ORIGINAL LAUNCHED 15.JAN.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
